#### Left-click

Left-clicking an entry is the default action, it opens a **diff editor**. *- red rectangle*

The **diff editor**  behaves differently depending on the entry type:
- **Local history entry:** Opens a diff comparing that snapshot against the **current version of the file on disk** (equivalent to selecting **Compare with File** from the context menu).
- **Git commit entry:** Opens a diff showing the changes introduced by that commit only (equivalent to selecting **Open Changes** from the context menu).

{{::il.Vscode_TimelineEntryLeftClick_img}}


#### Right-click

Right-clicking any entry in the **Timeline** opens a **Context menu** with additional actions. The **Context menu** provides alternative and additional ways to interact with entries beyond the default left-click behavior. *- yellow rectangle* 

{{::il.Vscode_TimelineEntryContextMenu_img}}

